# Every text file is LF in the working tree on every OS. Git for Windows defaults to CRLF on checkout, which
# fails Prettier on every file and breaks the husky hooks, whose first line then ends in a carriage return.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
